cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "imagewright: Image Generation Over One HTTP Contract"
abstract: >
  imagewright generates images through one HTTP contract,
  /v1/images/generations. It is planned to hold a client, local servers for
  FLUX.2 Klein and SDXL-Lightning that answer the contract, an in-process
  mode that needs no server, and an MCP tool. It depends on no knowledge
  graph package.
